----- stdout -----
Build, inspect, and generate artifacts for Pina Solana programs.

Use 'pina init' to start a program, 'pina idl' to inspect its public interface, 'pina codama generate' to render clients, and 'pina profile' to inspect a compiled SBF binary.

Usage: pina <COMMAND>

Commands:
  idl
          Generate a Codama IDL from a Pina program crate
  docs
          Read bundled Pina reference documentation in the terminal
  init
          Initialize a new Pina program project
  profile
          Profile compute-unit costs in a compiled SBF program
  codama
          Run Codama IDL and client-generation workflows
  help
          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version

Examples:
  pina init counter_program
  pina idl --path ./programs/counter_program --output ./idls/counter_program.json
  pina codama generate --example counter_program
  pina profile ./target/deploy/counter_program.so --json

Agent discovery:
  Run 'pina <command> --help' for command-specific inputs, outputs, and examples.
  Run 'pina docs' to list the bundled architecture and IDL reference topics.

